Hello {{profile.firstName}},

we are pleased to inform you that you have moved up from the waiting list and are now listed as a participant for the
event {{event.name}}. We wish you an exciting and inspiring event.

{{#if profile.isGuest}}
Your registration and further events
Only through your personal link can you register for further related events. When you register for another event, you
will enter your registration data again and then confirm your e-mail address. This ensures that the registration really
comes from you.
