{{/if}}

{{#if profile.isGuest}}
You will receive all important information by e-mail
Since you registered on the MINTvernetzt Community Platform without a profile, we will send you all important
information about the event by e-mail. Therefore, it is best to keep these e-mails safe.

Please note: The links in our e-mails are personal and intended only for you. Please do not share them with others.
{{/if}}

We are looking forward to seeing you!

Best regards,
Your MINTvernetzt team